WEBVTT

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:43.230
Shuurei and the others were on a boat heading for Kyuusai Cove to search for Ryuuki.

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:47.140
My soul friends! Hold on tight to the boat!

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.850
We can't hold on any tighter than this!

00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:51.940
Is that so? But we're approaching the falls.

00:01:51.940 --> 00:01:52.810
What?

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:54.320
One could call it a waterfall.

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:55.800
W-Waterfall?!

00:01:57.540 --> 00:01:58.770
Here we go!

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:02.030
Once we've passed the waterfall,
we're only a step away from Kyuusai Cove!

00:02:20.830 --> 00:02:22.770
Hey, Princess.

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.760
Princess, wake up.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.430
You too!

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.480
Where's the waterfall?!

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:36.000
We're done with the waterfall. We're in Kyuusai Cove already.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.440
We're soaking wet.

00:02:38.440 --> 00:02:41.200
Of course, after doing something as reckless as that.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.360
But as a result, we got here in half a day instead of three days.

00:02:44.360 --> 00:02:47.210
I'm freezing. I'm gonna catch a cold.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.120
Where's Ryuuren?

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:50.980
He's gone to look for a hot spring.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.370
A hot spring?

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.450
Apparently there's one near here.

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.900
Let's bathe and warm up first.

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:58.150
Then we can go look for the Emperor—

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.160
It seems a visitor got to the hot spring before us.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.140
You can bathe in the hot spring first, if you wish.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:13.040
It's been a while, hasn't it, oujo-chan?

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.930
Shun-san...

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:17.090
I'm here to pick up oujo-chan.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:19.050
Who ordered you?

00:03:19.050 --> 00:03:20.550
An old woman from the Hyou family.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:24.800
What business does a woman from the Hyou family have with me?

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:25.590
No idea.

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:29.100
The woman from the Hyou family isn't my master.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:32.900
Did the person I'm looking for come here?

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.650
I found the Emperor.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.770
He's sleeping in the shrine at the summit of the mountain.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:37.690
Sleeping?

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.320
Altitude sickness.

00:03:40.690 --> 00:03:41.730
Don't worry.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:45.970
Unless it's severe, he'll be fine after he rests for a while.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:51.210
So, you're taking me to that shrine out of kindness?

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:51.960
That's right.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.320
It will be much faster than stumbling in there after getting lost.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:58.670
But I'm only taking oujo-chan, not you guys.

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.840
Then I'll give the two of you different tasks.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:09.130
You're gonna leave Ensei and me behind?

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.040
Of course not!

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.230
Ensei, go catch some indigo ducks.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:16.640
Tan-tan will search for monkey-head mushrooms.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:17.980
What? Mushrooms?

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:20.980
Apparently both of them are only found in Kyuusai Cove.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:24.580
You won't mind if they happen to end up at the shrine on the summit of the mountain,

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:28.120
while they look for mushrooms and indigo ducks, do you?

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.980
Not at all.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:36.070
My orders were to bring oujo-chan to the shrine by herself.

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:38.930
It doesn't matter to me if someone follows us secretly.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:42.450
Well, I'll walk slowly for you two.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.470
So, shall we, Tan-tan?

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:55.100
Don't lose sight of the Princess 'cause you got carried away searching for those monkey-head mushrooms.

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.850
You'd better watch where you're going and not end up on the next mountain,

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:00.510
just because you were searching for those delicious-sounding ducks.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:06.780
I think I might actually do that.
I think I might actually do that.

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:21.510
How come the water in the lake is the color of jade?

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.580
I've never seen this before.

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:26.010
Because the bottom of the lake is clearly visible,

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:30.390
the lake appears to be shallow, but it's actually quite deep, so don't step into it carelessly.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.250
The color of the water is one of the mysteries of Kyuusai Cove,

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.050
but my master reckons that there's a reason for it.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.540
Your master?

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.280
What's the reason?

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:46.690
Apparently, the soil on this mountain differs from other areas.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:51.170
The soil probably dissolves into the water slowly and turns it green.

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:53.240
That's the origin of the jade coloring,

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.930
and the reason why there are no fish.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.870
There are no fish?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:01.520
No, which is one of the reasons why Kyuusai Cove is called an earthly paradise.

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:03.880
Presumably, the soil is also responsible for the lack of fish.

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:08.880
The water is extremely clear
because there's nothing for fish to eat.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:11.190
That's why fish can't survive.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.390
Come on, keep walking!

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:18.390
Yeah, yeah.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.900
Well done, you two.

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.080
Shun-san...

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:31.430
You're Shiba Jin, the childhood friend of Ran-shogun and the ex-fiancé of Jyuusan-hime, aren't you?

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:34.170
You're mistaking me for someone else.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:37.160
Then you're not related to the Ran family?

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:38.350
Yeah.

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:43.420
That's fine then.

00:06:50.790 --> 00:06:54.050
There's a fast-flowing river near here.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:55.000
Oh.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.030
This is the last obstacle.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.000
After these stairs, the shrine will be right in front of you.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:18.060
Is the Emperor really there?

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:21.220
He is. Now, let's go.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.390
This is the shrine.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.610
Over there.

00:07:58.880 --> 00:07:59.900
Ryuuki!

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:10.400
I'm... I'm glad you're safe.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.780
Do you realize how worried I was?

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:24.270
Ryu—

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.120
Welcome, little girl.

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:32.130
Shusui?!

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.110
I could hardly wait for you.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:42.890
This... feels the same as that time in Sashuu!

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:47.580
Shusu... Ryuu... ki...

00:09:01.320 --> 00:09:02.270
Where am I?

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:03.980
Are you finally awake?

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:07.490
Shusui?!

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:10.710
The body is hers. I'm borrowing it for a while.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:15.490
Pleased to meet you.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:18.330
I am the older sister of Hyou Riou, the head of the family.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:20.120
My name is Hyou Ruka.

00:09:20.890 --> 00:09:22.140
Hyou Riou?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.850
You're Riou-dono's older sister?

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.240
Now...

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:32.160
I did not expect you to come all the way here.

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:37.300
By the way, why don't you renounce your throne?

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.360
You find it painful to be the Emperor, isn't that right?

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:43.680
From the outset, you didn't want to become the Emperor.

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:50.480
I watched you weep, crying out that you were in pain.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.250
You're not an Emperor...

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.870
Not if you foolishly come to places like this.

00:09:56.870 --> 00:09:59.030
Deep in your heart, you know.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:03.860
You cannot be an Emperor if you run the country for the sake of one woman.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:06.510
That's why people abandon you.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:09.490
That's why you can't see anything until you're all alone.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.090
What kind of Emperor did you aim to be?

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:15.840
Where is the Emperor you aspired to be?

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.550
I-I was...

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:23.380
You've run and run and run, and now you've ended up in a place like this.

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:27.440
You're so foolish. Are you a complete idiot?

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:31.970
If you love that woman so much, why don't you renounce your throne and be with her?

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:36.160
If you do that much for her,
surely she won't reject you anymore?

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:40.500
She'll probably even take care of you.

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:46.830
Now, say that you'll forsake your throne!

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:49.330
You don't deserve a throne.

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.140
There are others who deserve it more than you do.

00:11:02.540 --> 00:11:04.100
Now...

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:08.520
Say it. Say that you will renounce your throne.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.840
Go on.

00:11:10.890 --> 00:11:12.020
N...

00:11:12.370 --> 00:11:13.520
Huh?

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:15.770
Never.

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:16.820
What?

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.070
I said, "Never."

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:22.200
I won't abdicate the throne.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.020
I promised myself that I wouldn't.

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:30.540
I've run away when I shouldn't have.

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:35.560
To you as a person? Or as the Emperor?

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:43.970
I couldn't even answer that question because I was not an Emperor then.

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:49.370
Not an Emperor at all, even if I wished to be one.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.190
That's why I came to Houkyou Mountain!

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:59.660
Because you heard that only the true Emperor can reach the shrine on Houkyou Mountain?

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:00.930
That's right.

00:12:01.440 --> 00:12:03.170
I wanted to test whether I am the Emperor.

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:05.450
I want to be the true Emperor,

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:09.370
and I want that from deep in my heart!

00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:12.570
I am the Emperor.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:15.710
Until the end of my life, I won't give up being the Emperor!

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:18.810
I won't be just Shi Ryuuki!

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:27.550
As the Emperor, I will return to Kiyou, where people are waiting for me.

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:35.480
I won't run away anymore.

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:37.190
I am the Emperor.

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:41.880
Until the end of my life, I will always be the Emperor!

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.650
That was well said.

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.700
I have heard your words.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.730
Such a stubborn child. Very well.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:23.910
As you know, the authorities cannot touch Kyuusai Cove.

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:27.070
Anything can happen here.

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:31.690
Shun and Shusui, take this child's life.

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:32.680
You heard me.

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.650
Shusui!

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:40.380
Don't push yourself!

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:44.360
Sh-Shuuei, how long have you been here?

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.840
For some time.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.630
Ever since you were picking mushrooms and playing with pandas.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:53.520
And of course, I was watching when that idiot picked up Your Highness after you'd fainted.

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:57.020
You could at least thank me, Shuuei.

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.030
Give me a break from your jokes.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:01.400
How can you say that when you're the one who captured Shuurei-dono?

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:03.100
Is Shuurei here?!

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:06.900
Yes, Shuurei-dono has come here to bring you back.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.650
She cried when she saw you sleeping.

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:11.900
Aren't you a fortunate man?

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:15.160
You've got to get back to Kiyou no matter what, don't you?

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:17.600
Shuurei...

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:34.330
Sh-Shusui?!

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:35.720
It's called brainwashing.

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:38.760
Brainwashing and assassination are the specialties of the Hyou family!

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:45.480
I can't escape from her if I'm carrying His Highness.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.190
Damn it!

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:50.820
Jyuusan-hime!

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:54.330
Brother, I'll handle that idiot Jin!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.580
Do something about Shusui-san, hurry!

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:57.200
Hey, Hotaru.

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:00.840
There's no other way!

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:03.080
Shuuei, don't hurt Shusui!

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:04.190
I know!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.020
Shuuei, can't you help her through your love?!

00:15:13.020 --> 00:15:14.890
That's the usual way of reversing brainwashing, right?!

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:17.810
Exactly! That's the only thing you have anyway, brother!

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.770
Shusui-dono, please wake up!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.020
Shusui-dono!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:24.690
It's not working.

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.440
I seriously didn't want to do this,

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:29.530
but this is the last resort!

00:15:38.800 --> 00:15:41.850
Look! There's Shouka-sama!

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:51.130
Shuuei! Have you no pride as a man?!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.090
How shameful!

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.730
That was appalling, brother!

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:57.510
You know, there's a limit to not caring about your appearance.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:01.980
Hey, shut up! I didn't have any choice, damn it!

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.230
Shusui-dono, please wake up!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:06.720
Shusui-dono!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:08.090
Shusui-dono!

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:13.610
How dare you!

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.950
I'll take the blame.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:20.450
No, you won't! I'll decline any offer you make!

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.790
Your Highness...

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.760
Shusui, I'm so glad for you.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:27.530
What are you doing here?

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:30.410
Umm, I... was on a journey to find myself.

00:16:30.410 --> 00:16:31.510
Anyway, what about Shuurei?!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:33.210
Is Shuurei-sama here?

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:36.390
Oujo-chan is asleep in the back room of the shrine.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.050
Oh, thanks.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:42.000
Why are you thanking the man who's trying to murder you?!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.350
B-But...

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:47.900
I don't sense that he's threatening my life.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.330
Now, all of you get moving.

00:16:51.330 --> 00:16:53.540
I'll deal with this guy.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.530
Please, brother.

00:16:58.170 --> 00:16:59.270
Okay.

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.870
Shuuei, you're leaving your sister behind?!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.360
What about Shuurei?!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.670
You're the Emperor!

00:17:06.670 --> 00:17:08.720
It's a matter of priorities.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.880
Please be more aware of your importance!

00:17:20.930 --> 00:17:22.810
Barahime...

00:17:23.660 --> 00:17:29.810
Riou will be happy. Finally, Riou will look at me.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:34.650
If I have a body that shares the blood of Barahime...

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.300
he will surely...

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:39.660
Hold it right there, Ruka.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:46.200
Long time no see, Kokurou.

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.380
I will go look for Shuurei-sama.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.540
Please.

00:17:52.680 --> 00:17:55.250
The Ran family is in charge of managing Kyuusai Cove.

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:59.850
If I'm not mistaken, there's a Ran family boat there.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.180
Huh?

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.550
Who's that?

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:11.460
Who is that again? I think I've seen him somewhere.

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:13.980
That's my foolish brother number four.

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.350
Let him on the boat.

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:17.400
The other one is the Emperor.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:21.030
Oh, right, so the Emperor is okay?

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.700
Well then, please get in.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:26.450
Oh, make sure you don't step on the ducks or mushrooms.

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:32.060
Did you come here to kill the Emperor?

00:18:32.060 --> 00:18:33.840
Maybe.

00:18:34.650 --> 00:18:37.840
Hotaru, is that Emperor kind to you?

00:18:37.840 --> 00:18:39.720
Much more than you are.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.210
I see.

00:18:41.210 --> 00:18:43.330
That's a bit disappointing.

00:18:44.320 --> 00:18:49.170
Hyou Ruka, I thought that you were long dead.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:52.590
You're just as rude as ever.

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:55.870
I never disliked you.

00:18:56.860 --> 00:19:01.360
However, I've decided to take this girl.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.890
I won't let you have her.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:15.010
Has Ensei-dono gone to find Shuurei-dono?

00:19:15.010 --> 00:19:15.690
Yeah.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.760
I see.

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.380
Please take care of His Highness.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.010
Ryuuren, will you come with me?

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:29.640
Suou-dono, if worse comes to worst, please escape with the Emperor.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:30.650
Gotcha.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:40.190
Jin, I was happy with you.

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:44.490
But I understand now that I can't be with you anymore.

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.530
You can't be with me either.

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:49.910
We can't be happy together, not if we include everything else.

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:54.480
I loved Shiba Jin, but I won't anymore.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:56.750
Jin's dead, after all.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:00.220
Give me back that eyepatch.

00:20:01.820 --> 00:20:04.800
That's something I gave to Jin!

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:09.680
You won't die for me anymore, will you?

00:20:13.010 --> 00:20:15.230
That's right, Hotaru.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.330
I cannot die for you anymore.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.940
What are you doing?!

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.150
But Shuurei and Shusui are...

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:58.380
Listen up.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.820
Everybody came here to rescue you.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.170
Will you stop doing things that would make their effort meaningless?

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:06.200
You're the Emperor, aren't you?!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:11.820
I understand.

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:14.580
You're right.

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:17.810
I'm done living my life for Jin.

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:21.960
From this moment, I'll live my life for myself!

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:27.940
I've never met a better woman than you, Hotaru.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.350
That name...

00:21:29.350 --> 00:21:31.720
That name doesn't belong to you either!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.860
It is mine.

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:37.600
I don't know any other name for you than Hotaru.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.160
Hotaru is a name only for me.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:45.450
This is the only thing I won't give up.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:59.410
You're going to break the shintai of Houkyou Mountain just to get rid of me.

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.420
Do you know what will happen if you do?

00:22:04.100 --> 00:22:11.260
Indeed, if you break the mirror, then I, as a spirit, will have to return to my body.

00:22:11.260 --> 00:22:18.200
However, Houkyou Mountain is named for that mirror, within which monsters are sealed.

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:20.350
Once they're released...

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:23.930
Stop whining just because there will be a bit more work for the Hyou family.

00:22:23.930 --> 00:22:25.650
Just get on with your work.

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:31.980
I honestly don't dislike you.

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:36.580
You're icy cool, always rational and realistic.

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:41.590
You'd destroy anything to get hold of what you love.

00:22:41.590 --> 00:22:45.150
You'd never hesitate, no matter what misfortune it may bring.

00:22:45.770 --> 00:22:48.890
You and I are cut from the same cloth.

00:24:45.350 --> 00:24:47.630
The earth cracks, and the sky falls.

00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:50.980
Kyuusai Cove rages with anger,
and Houkyou Mountain cries out in sorrow.

00:24:50.980 --> 00:24:52.510
The sound of the erhu echoes.

00:24:52.960 --> 00:24:54.970
Ran-shogun, welcome back.

00:24:55.470 --> 00:24:57.090
I'm glad for you, Ryuuki!
